# File map

Read `AGENTS.md` for the full index. `CLAUDE.md` has design/TDD/Zig 0.17 rules. Do not grep the tree to find the right file.

| Change | File(s) |
| --- | --- |
| Framework API or comptime checks | `src/zigma.zig` only |
| Aida records/entities/`DefinedType` | `examples/aida/src/aida.zig` |
| Example app (`system` + `addAppFromDep`) | `examples/aida/` |
| Positive tests | `test/aida_test.zig` |
| Compile-error case | `test/compile_errors/<name>.zig` + `compile_error_cases` in `build.zig` |
| Record JSON | `src/json.zig`, `test/json_test.zig` (`test/tiny_system.zig` for non-aida) |
| WASM page | `src/frontend/main.zig`, `src/frontend/main.js`, `src/frontend/index.html` |
| Consumer widgets (`domain type → { make, read }`) | `examples/aida/src/widgets.js` (`addApp` `widgets_js`) |
| Consumer page title | `addApp` / `addAppFromDep` optional `title` (generated `title.js`) |
| HTTP backend | `src/http/main.zig` |
| Build graph / modules / `addApp` | `build.zig` |
| Package metadata | `build.zig.zon` |

Agree on the step before coding. Red test first; wait for review before the fix.
